ThinIce Xfwm4 theme
-------------------
A window frame for the ThinIce GTK theme (gtk-classic-themes), built from the shapes of the ThinIce engine:

 - the corners are cut at 45 degrees at the top left and the bottom right, like the ThinIce scrollbar slider;
 - the title bar carries the diagonal "slash" grip (a dark pair and a light pair of lines) on both sides of the title text;
 - the buttons are 1 px bevelled squares with the same two corners cut.

Colours are the ThinIce ones: window #D3D3DD, active #C1C1CC, selection #336699, light #ffffff, dark #8e8ea1. Title text colours
are not set in themerc, so they follow the GTK theme.

Buttons: menu, stick, shade, hide, maximize and close, with the toggled, pressed and inactive images for each.

License: LGPL-2.1, like the rest of gtk-classic-themes.
